'' RUN: array slices under -exx; nothing is printed first (the abort goes to stderr unbuffered) (docs/tiko-slices RFC-0003 §4, §7) -- see the source's header.
'' The -earray check stops it with runtime error 6 and exit 6 where the span is read.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -exx -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/array-slice-exx-erase.tiko -o tests/codegen/arraysliceexxerase.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/arraysliceexxerase.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/arraysliceexxerase.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 6
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: runtime error 6 (out of bounds array access) at line 12 of
